1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:16,080
oooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo

2
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:19,660
Behind cold walls where the light feels small

3
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:22,680
Dreams fall silent afraid to call

4
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:26,140
Names forgotten, hope running low

5
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:29,960
Children learning what they don't know

6
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:40,960
But in the air a whisper starts, a fragile sound from open hearts.

7
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:44,960
Sing little hearts, don't be afraid.

8
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:51,960
Darkness fades when a song is made, where the world once closed the door.

9
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:57,960
Light is born in the voice once more.

10
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:05,960
Heavy rules and endless days, words like shadows, cold and gray.

11
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:14,960
Still inside a rhythm stays, no one can take that song away.

12
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:25,960
Every note becomes a place where we belong, where we are safe.

13
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:28,960
Sing little hearts, don't hide your sound.

14
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:35,960
Silence breaks when hope is found, if you were taught to fall before.

15
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:41,960
Now you learn what wings are through.

16
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:48,960
You are more than your yesterday, more than the hurt that made you stay.

17
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:58,960
You are a voice clear and strong, waiting to rise, waiting for song.

18
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:05,960
We sing together side by side, many voices one inside.

19
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:15,960
In the echo a note's a gone piece lives on.

20
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:23,960
And when the world feels close again, the song remains hard.

21
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:50,960
Thank you for watching!

